    "CAEG-Net V1 (251.74 MW) outperforms Standalone GRU and Static Equal Ensemble (279.79 MW).",
    "CAEG-Net V1 achieves statistical parity with the single strongest temporal expert, Standalone TCN (254.43 MW, p=0.9011)."
